---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="월코 사역 — Word of Life Korea"
  description="캠프, 제주월비, 청소년 사역, SYME로 이어지는 Word of Life Korea의 다음 세대 사역을 한눈에 살펴보세요."
  activeNav="ministry"
>
  <main class="ministry-hub">
    <section class="mh-hero">
      <div class="mh-orbit mh-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mh-orbit mh-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mh-shell mh-hero-inner">
        <div class="mh-hero-copy">
          <p class="mh-eyebrow">OUR MINISTRIES</p>
          <h1>
            <span class="wl-ko">다음 세대를 세우는<br><em>네 개의 사역</em></span>
            <span class="wl-en">Four Ministries,<br><em>One Gospel</em></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mh-hero-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">캠프의 특별한 만남부터 일상의 제자훈련과 깊이 있는 성경교육까지, 월코는 복음으로 다음 세대의 삶을 연결합니다.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">From life-changing camps to everyday discipleship and in-depth Bible training, WOLKO connects the next generation with the Gospel.</span>
          </p>
          <a class="mh-hero-cta" href="#ministry-overview">
            <span class="wl-ko">사역 한눈에 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore the Ministries</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-mosaic" aria-label="월코 주요 사역">
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-camp" href="#camp-ministry">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/WOLKO_Hero.JPG" alt="월코 캠프 현장" loading="eager">
            <span><small>01</small><strong class="wl-ko">캠프</strong><strong class="wl-en">Camp</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-wolbi" href="#wolbi-ministry">
            <img src="/images/wolbi-jeju/hero-campus-spring-2026.jpeg" alt="제주월비 학생들" loading="eager">
            <span><small>02</small><strong class="wl-ko">제주월비</strong><strong class="wl-en">Jeju WOLBI</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-youth" href="#youth-ministry">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Youth_Ministry/CT.png" alt="월코 청소년 사역" loading="lazy">
            <span><small>03</small><strong class="wl-ko">청소년 사역</strong><strong class="wl-en">Youth</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-syme" href="#syme-ministry">
            <img src="/images/syme-community.jpg" alt="SYME 공동체 모임" loading="lazy">
            <span><small>04</small><strong>SYME</strong></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-intro" id="ministry-overview">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-intro-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="mh-section-kicker"><span class="wl-ko">월코의 사역</span><span class="wl-en">WOLKO MINISTRIES</span></p>
          <h2><span class="wl-ko">각기 다른 현장,<br>하나의 분명한 목적</span><span class="wl-en">Different Settings,<br>One Clear Purpose</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mh-intro-copy">
          <span class="wl-ko">모든 사역은 청소년과 청년이 복음을 듣고, 말씀 안에서 성장하며, 지역 교회와 세상 속에서 그리스도의 제자로 살아가도록 돕는 한 가지 목적을 향합니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Every ministry shares one purpose: helping young people hear the Gospel, grow in God's Word, and live as disciples of Christ in their churches and communities.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
        <nav class="mh-jump" aria-label="사역 바로가기">
          <a href="#camp-ministry"><span class="wl-ko">캠프</span><span class="wl-en">Camp</span></a>
          <a href="#wolbi-ministry"><span class="wl-ko">제주월비</span><span class="wl-en">Jeju WOLBI</span></a>
          <a href="#youth-ministry"><span class="wl-ko">청소년 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Youth</span></a>
          <a href="#syme-ministry">SYME</a>
        </nav>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-programs" aria-label="월코 사역 목록">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-program-grid">
        <article class="mh-card" id="camp-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/camp" aria-label="캠프 사역 자세히 보기">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/Camp_Group.jpg" alt="캠프 참가자 단체 사진" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">01</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">CAMP MINISTRY</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">캠프 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Camp Ministry</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-lead"><span class="wl-ko">한 번의 캠프가 평생을 바꾸는 경험이 됩니다.</span><span class="wl-en">One camp can become a life-changing experience.</span></p>
            <p class="mh-card-desc"><span class="wl-ko">말씀을 통해 삶의 방향을 다시 세우고, 훈련된 리더와 공동체 안에서 자신을 돌아보며 복음 안에서 새로운 비전과 기쁨을 경험하도록 돕습니다. 단순한 행사로 끝나지 않고, 복음 전도와 제자훈련을 통해 삶의 변화를 목표로 합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">We help campers rebuild their direction through God's Word, reflect with trained leaders and a caring community, and discover new vision and joy in the Gospel. Camp is more than an event: the goal is real life change through evangelism and discipleship.</span></p>
            <ul class="mh-points">
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">복음을 분명하게 듣는 말씀 시간</span><span class="wl-en">Clear Gospel messages</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">선교사님들이 전하는 복음 말씀으로 인생의 방향과 비전을 발견합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Missionaries share the Gospel so campers can discover direction and vision for their lives.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">함께 걷는 상담자와 공동체</span><span class="wl-en">Counselors and community</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">훈련된 상담자와 친구들 곁에서 고민을 나누고 복음 안에서 답을 찾습니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Trained counselors and friends walk alongside campers as they share struggles and find answers in the Gospel.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">영어 환경에서의 경험</span><span class="wl-en">An English-speaking environment</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">원어민 선생님들과 함께 생활하며 영어 실력과 영적 성장을 함께 키웁니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Living with native-speaking teachers helps campers grow in English and in faith together.</span></p></div></li>
            </ul>
            <dl class="mh-facts">
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">프로그램</span><span class="wl-en">Programs</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">영어캠프 · 제주캠프 · 연합캠프</span><span class="wl-en">English · Jeju · Union Camps</span></dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">대상</span><span class="wl-en">For</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">영어캠프 초6–중3 / 제주캠프 고1–고3</span><span class="wl-en">English Camp: Grades 6–9 / Jeju Camp: Grades 10–12</span></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/camp">
              <span class="wl-ko">캠프 사역 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore Camp Ministry</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="wolbi-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/wolbi-jeju" aria-label="제주월비 자세히 보기">
            <img src="/images/wolbi-jeju/hero-campus-spring-2026.jpeg" alt="제주월비 공동체" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">02</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">WORD OF LIFE BIBLE INSTITUTE</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">제주월비</span><span class="wl-en">WOLBI Jeju</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-lead"><span class="wl-ko">말씀 위에 굳게 세워지는 11개월.</span><span class="wl-en">Eleven months of being built on God's Word.</span></p>
            <p class="mh-card-desc"><span class="wl-ko">제주 월비(Word of Life Bible Institute)는 대학 과정에 준하는 체계적인 성경 교육과 제자훈련으로 다음 세대를 준비시키는 사역입니다. 세계 5개 대륙 10개 캠퍼스 네트워크의 일부로, 여러 나라의 청년들이 함께 배우고 사역합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">WOLBI Jeju (Word of Life Bible Institute) prepares the next generation through systematic, college-level Bible education and discipleship. As part of a network of 10 campuses on 5 continents, young people from many nations learn and serve together.</span></p>
            <ul class="mh-points">
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">성경 66권과 조직신학</span><span class="wl-en">All 66 books and theology</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">구약·신약 전권과 조직신학을 세계적인 교수진에게 영어로 배웁니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Study the Old and New Testaments and systematic theology in English with a world-class faculty.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">현장에서 배우는 선교</span><span class="wl-en">Missions in the field</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">태국·베트남 선교 여행(12월)과 이스라엘 성지 순례(3월)를 경험합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Join mission trips to Thailand and Vietnam (December) and a Holy Land pilgrimage to Israel (March).</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">다양한 나라의 공동체</span><span class="wl-en">A multicultural community</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">북미·한국·아시아 청년들이 함께 신앙 공동체를 이룹니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Students from North America, Korea, and Asia live as one community of faith.</span></p></div></li>
            </ul>
            <dl class="mh-facts">
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">과정</span><span class="wl-en">Program</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">11개월 집중 과정</span><span class="wl-en">11-month immersive program</span></dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">지원 자격</span><span class="wl-en">Eligibility</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">고등학교 졸업자 이상 (졸업예정자 포함)</span><span class="wl-en">High school graduates (including expected graduates)</span></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/wolbi-jeju">
              <span class="wl-ko">제주월비 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore WOLBI Jeju</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="youth-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/youth" aria-label="청소년 사역 자세히 보기">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Youth_Ministry/Banner%202.png" alt="청소년 사역 현장" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">03</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">YOUTH MINISTRY</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">청소년 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Youth Ministry</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-lead"><span class="wl-ko">프로그램보다 복음이 흘러가는 구조를 세웁니다.</span><span class="wl-en">We build a structure where the Gospel keeps flowing, not just a program.</span></p>
            <p class="mh-card-desc"><span class="wl-ko">선생님과 리더가 먼저 복음으로 세워지고, 학생들에게 복음이 흘러가며, 복음을 들은 학생들이 다시 친구를 초대하는 흐름을 만들어 갑니다. 월코는 교회와 다양한 사역 현장이 이 건강한 순환 위에 서도록 돕습니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Teachers and leaders are first established in the Gospel, the Gospel then flows to students, and those who hear it invite their friends. WOLKO helps churches and ministry settings stand on this healthy cycle.</span></p>
            <ul class="mh-points">
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">리더를 먼저 세웁니다</span><span class="wl-en">Leaders first</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">교회와 사역 현장의 선생님·리더에게 복음을 전하고 실제 사역에 필요한 훈련을 제공합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">We share the Gospel with church and ministry leaders and equip them with practical training.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">친구가 친구에게</span><span class="wl-en">Friend to friend</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">전도 이벤트와 다양한 모임에서 학생들이 친구를 초대하고 복음을 나눕니다.</span><span class="wl-en">At outreach events and gatherings, students invite friends and share the Gospel.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">교회 공동체로 연결</span><span class="wl-en">Connected to church</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">영접한 학생들이 예배와 양육, 제자훈련 안에서 계속 성장하도록 돕습니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Students who receive Christ keep growing through worship, nurture, and discipleship.</span></p></div></li>
            </ul>
            <dl class="mh-facts">
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">핵심</span><span class="wl-en">Focus</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">리더 훈련 · 학생 사역 · 전도 이벤트</span><span class="wl-en">Leader training · Student ministry · Outreach events</span></dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">협력</span><span class="wl-en">Partners</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">교회 청소년부 · 선생님 · 사역 리더</span><span class="wl-en">Church youth groups · Teachers · Ministry leaders</span></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/youth">
              <span class="wl-ko">청소년 사역 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore Youth Ministry</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="syme-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/jr-syme" aria-label="SYME 제자훈련 자세히 보기">
            <img src="/images/syme-community.jpg" alt="SYME 학생들과 스태프 단체 사진" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">04</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">JR. SYME DISCIPLESHIP</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">SYME 제자훈련</span><span class="wl-en">SYME Discipleship</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-lead"><span class="wl-ko">영어 안에서 말씀에 뿌리내리는 3주.</span><span class="wl-en">Three weeks of taking root in the Word, in English.</span></p>
            <p class="mh-card-desc"><span class="wl-ko">Jr. SYME은 방학을 활용한 3주 영어 제자훈련 프로그램입니다. 언어 학습을 넘어 Word of Life의 검증된 성경 커리큘럼 안에서 말씀에 뿌리내리고, 복음을 전하는 리더로 성장하는 것을 목표로 합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Jr. SYME is a three-week English discipleship program held during school vacation. Beyond language learning, students take root in the Word through Word of Life's proven Bible curriculum and grow into leaders who share the Gospel.</span></p>
            <ul class="mh-points">
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">모든 활동이 영어로</span><span class="wl-en">Everything in English</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">모든 강의와 활동이 영어로 진행되어 언어와 신앙이 함께 자랍니다.</span><span class="wl-en">All lessons and activities are in English, so language and faith grow together.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">말씀 위에 삶을 세우기</span><span class="wl-en">Life built on the Word</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">성경 묵상, 말씀 암송, 소그룹 나눔으로 하나님의 말씀 위에 삶을 세웁니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Bible meditation, Scripture memorization, and small groups build life on God's Word.</span></p></div></li>
                <li><span class="mh-point-dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m5 10.5 3.2 3.2L15 6.8"/></svg></span><div><strong><span class="wl-ko">또래와 함께하는 공동체</span><span class="wl-en">Community with peers</span></strong><p><span class="wl-ko">3주간의 공동체 생활로 서로 세우고 도전하며 성장합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Three weeks of shared life where students encourage and challenge one another.</span></p></div></li>
            </ul>
            <dl class="mh-facts">
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">대상</span><span class="wl-en">For</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">중·고등학생 (7–12학년)</span><span class="wl-en">Middle and high school students (Grades 7–12)</span></dd></div>
                <div><dt><span class="wl-ko">기간</span><span class="wl-en">Duration</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">방학 3주 집중과정</span><span class="wl-en">3-week vacation intensive</span></dd></div>
            </dl>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/jr-syme">
              <span class="wl-ko">SYME 자세히 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore SYME</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-closing">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-closing-card">
        <div>
          <p class="mh-section-kicker"><span class="wl-ko">함께 알아보기</span><span class="wl-en">START A CONVERSATION</span></p>
